/target
**/*.rs.bk
# Cargo.lock is committed on purpose: this workspace ships the `klions`
# and `klions-lsp` binaries, and releases build with --locked so the
# published artifacts are reproducible. (Ignoring it is the right default
# for a library-only workspace, which this is not.)
editors/vscode/node_modules
editors/vscode/out
*.klm

# extra safety
.env
.env.*
!*.env.example
*.pem
*.key
credentials*
venv/
.venv/
node_modules/
*.gguf
*.pt
*.safetensors
*.vsix
.claude/
